SUMMARY:Study Day 6: SQL Window Functions & Advanced Analytics
DESCRIPTION:Cover window functions (ROW_NUMBER, RANK, LAG, LEAD), CTEs, and cohort analysis. Solve 2 practice questions.\n\nTopics:\n- Window functions: ROW_NUMBER, RANK, DENSE_RANK\n- LAG and LEAD for previous/next row values\n- Running totals with SUM() OVER()\n- Common Table Expressions (CTEs)\n- Cohort analysis\n\nPractice Problems:\n1. Running Total & Rank with Window Functions\n2. Cohort Retention Analysis with CTEs\n\nResources:\n- Mode Analytics Window Functions\n- SQLBolt Window Functions\n- Use The Index Window Functions
